# M17 workstream — verification transcript, 2026-11-22

Every line below is an actual run in this environment, in the order it happened. Exit statuses are
the process status, never the status of a later pipeline stage: where a command was filtered, the
filter is shown as a separate step and the raw status is recorded from the unfiltered run.

Environment, stated because three of the numbers below depend on it:
    sandbox clock at the first measurement: Sun 2026-11-22T00:57:06Z (`date -u`)
    python 3.11, no virtualenv, `TMPDIR=/tmp` exported for every make target (the docs gate clones
      into a temp dir and inherits TMPDIR; the default sandbox tmp is not writable for it)
    `unicorn` NOT installed here -> the emulator-backed loader suites skip; that is the documented
      unprovisioned shape of this gate, not a pass, and it is why "skipped=109" appears below
    no block device exists and `mknod` is denied -> no physical test was possible or attempted
    network egress is limited to github.com, codeload, api.github.com, npmjs, pypi -> the `located`
      external rows of SECURITY_BOUNDARY.md §9 were read as retrieved excerpts, not fetched pages

