## 7. Boundary assertions, re-measured as the deliverable claims them

    $ grep -rln 'decrypt\|rsa_verify\|ecdsa\|aes_\|shacrypt' tools/*.py kernel/*.c
      tools/firmware.py  tools/pc5ctl.py  tools/presentation.py
    $ grep -nE 'decrypt' those three files
      firmware.py:13  "It does not decrypt firmware, extract keys, patch signatures, or bypass any"
      firmware.py:166 "The PFS image is AES-XTS encrypted; PC5 does not decrypt it."
      firmware.py:219 "PC5 firmware analysis (no decryption)"
      pc5ctl.py:8     "firmware analysis (no decryption)"
      presentation.py:686 "| analysed, decrypted or executed | **no**, in any sense |"
